Package: pulzr-base
Provides: parkeze-base
Replaces: parkeze-base
Conflicts: parkeze-base
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-uci, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-ubus, uci, ip-full, curl, ca-bundle, jshn, jsonfilter, ucode-mod-socket, openssh-server, openssh-keygen, dropbearconvert
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0 AND LicenseRef-FIGlet-font
Architecture: all
Description: Pulzar gateway base configuration, identity and branding.
 Network defaults, device identity derived from board serial, the shared UCI
 schema every other Pulzar package reads, and the login banner — whose
 wordmark is rendered from a FIGlet font at print time, because OpenWrt
 packages no figlet to depend on.
